[00:11.50] Lost in the Barrio
[00:13.79] I walk like an Injun
[00:16.38] So Carlo won't suspect
[00:18.89] Something's wrong here
[00:21.92] I dance in place
[00:24.70] And paint my face
[00:27.39] And act like I belong here
[00:33.36] Throw back the little ones
[00:35.83] And pan-fry the big ones
[00:38.39] Use tact, poise and reason
[00:40.95] And gently squeeze them
[00:44.59] 
